# Intentionally no /events/:id or /profile/history/recharge/:id rules.
#
# The app only uses query strings (/events/?id=123). A /events/:id 301 also
# matches Next.js static-export RSC files (/events/index.txt) and sends the
# browser to /events/?id=index.txt. Cloudflare Workers static assets do not
# support 200 rewrite/pass-through rules, so those files cannot be excluded
# reliably. 301s are also cached by browsers, so a bad rule keeps breaking
# clients after a redeploy until the cache is cleared.
